{"title": "Spider's Lyre", "pageid": 8877, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Spider's_Lyre", "categories": ["Musical Instruments", "Story items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-story\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Instrument_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Instrument_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.png/300px-Instrument_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/f3/Instrument_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Spider's Lyre image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Instrument_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.png/300px-Instrument_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Instrument_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Spider's Lyre</span></a> is a quest item that is dropped by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minthara\" title=\"Minthara\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/25px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/38px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/50px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Minthara\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/25px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Minthara\" title=\"Minthara\">Minthara</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nere\" title=\"Nere\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/Portrait_Nere.png/25px-Portrait_Nere.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/96/Portrait_Nere.png/38px-Portrait_Nere.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/96/Portrait_Nere.png/50px-Portrait_Nere.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nere\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/Portrait_Nere.png/25px-Portrait_Nere.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/96/Portrait_Nere.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nere\" title=\"Nere\">Nere</a>. The Lyre is used to summon a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kar%27niss\" title=\"Kar'niss\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Kar%27niss.png/25px-Portrait_Kar%27niss.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Kar%27niss.png/38px-Portrait_Kar%27niss.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Kar%27niss.png/50px-Portrait_Kar%27niss.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"guide\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Kar%27niss.png/25px-Portrait_Kar%27niss.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Portrait_Kar%27niss.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Kar%27niss\" title=\"Kar'niss\">guide</a> in crossing through the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Lands\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Lands\">Shadow-Cursed Lands</a> to reach <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>The strings of this lyre are as sharp as an assassin's blade. Pluck with care, or you may lose a fingertip.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Musical_Instruments\" title=\"Musical Instruments\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Musical_Instruments_Icon.png/25px-Musical_Instruments_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Musical_Instruments_Icon.png/38px-Musical_Instruments_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Musical_Instruments_Icon.png/50px-Musical_Instruments_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Musical Instruments\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Musical_Instruments_Icon.png/25px-Musical_Instruments_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Musical_Instruments_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Musical_Instruments\" title=\"Musical Instruments\">Musical Instruments</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/28px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Proficiency Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/28px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Required Proficiency: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Musical_Instruments\" title=\"Musical Instruments\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Musical_Instruments_Icon.png/25px-Musical_Instruments_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Musical_Instruments_Icon.png/38px-Musical_Instruments_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Musical_Instruments_Icon.png/50px-Musical_Instruments_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Musical Instruments\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Musical_Instruments_Icon.png/25px-Musical_Instruments_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Musical_Instruments_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Musical_Instruments\" title=\"Musical Instruments\">Musical Instruments</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Story Item\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Story Item</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 1 kg (2 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 1 kg (2 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_SCL_SpidersLyre</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_SCL_SpidersLyre\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_SCL_SpidersLyre\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">98282bec-aeaa-4490-ae43-0c27bed58c74</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:98282bec-aeaa-4490-ae43-0c27bed58c74\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:98282bec-aeaa-4490-ae43-0c27bed58c74\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre\" title=\"Play the Spider's Lyre\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp/40px-Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp/60px-Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp/80px-Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Play the Spider's Lyre\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp/40px-Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Play_the_Spider%27s_Lyre\" title=\"Play the Spider's Lyre\">Play the Spider's Lyre</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_(Lyre)\" title=\"Perform (Lyre)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp/40px-Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp/60px-Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp/80px-Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perform (Lyre)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp/40px-Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Perform_Lyre_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Perform_(Lyre)\" title=\"Perform (Lyre)\">Perform (Lyre)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Held by <a href=\"/wiki/Minthara\" title=\"Minthara\">Minthara</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin_Camp\" title=\"Goblin Camp\">Goblin Camp</a>. Can be pickpocketed or taken off of her if killed or knocked out.</li>\n<li>If the party sides with Minthara, she instead provides the lyre after the camp celebration.</li>\n<li>Dropped by <a href=\"/wiki/Nere\" title=\"Nere\">Nere</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a> if killed.</li>\n<li>If the party lets <a href=\"/wiki/Nere\" title=\"Nere\">Nere</a> live and convinces him to help them get through the shadow lands, he provides the Lyre.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 215.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 213.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Selena-t-st-spiderlyre.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Render by Selena Tobin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Selena-t-st-spiderlyre.jpg/320px-Selena-t-st-spiderlyre.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Selena-t-st-spiderlyre.jpg/480px-Selena-t-st-spiderlyre.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Selena-t-st-spiderlyre.jpg/640px-Selena-t-st-spiderlyre.jpg.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Render by Selena Tobin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Selena-t-st-spiderlyre.jpg/320px-Selena-t-st-spiderlyre.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"214\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Selena-t-st-spiderlyre.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Render by Selena Tobin</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"In-Game_Performance\">In-Game Performance</span></h2>\n<center>\n<figure class=\"embedvideo\" data-service=\"youtube\" data-mw-iframeconfig=\"{&quot;width&quot;:400,&quot;height&quot;:225,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/xRo80Bm-RUI?autoplay=1&quot;}\" style=\"width:400px\">\n\t<div class=\"embedvideo-wrapper\" style=\"height:225px\">\n\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-consent\" data-show-privacy-notice=\"1\">\n\t<div class=\"embedvideo-overlay\">\n\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-loader\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-loader__